```console
$ scherzo-cloud runner credential list --help
List runner credential metadata

Usage: scherzo-cloud runner credential list [OPTIONS] <ORGANIZATION> <RUNNER>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <RUNNER>        Runner ID or exact name

Options:
      --limit <LIMIT>                  Maximum items to return (1-200)
      --cursor <CURSOR>                Opaque continuation cursor
      --json                           Print the runner result as JSON
      --service-api-key-file <PATH|->  Authenticate with a service API key from a private file, or - for standard input
      --allow-insecure-http            Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                           Print help

Privacy:
  The list contains credential metadata, not secrets.

Pagination:
  This command returns one page. Pass --cursor <CURSOR> to continue.

```
